WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Publish the reviewed draft in Course builder.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Use Planner in the builder or Assign on the course in Course library.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Select locations, any permission-level and staff filters, a due date and required/optional status.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Press Assign course explicitly. Review or cancel existing assignments in the same popup.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 5: Archive a course when it should leave the library while retaining existing learning results.
